      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……私は軍師です。\r\n弟の命と民の命、\r\nどちらを助けるか、決めなければなりません。",
        "official_en": "I am a strategist. That means I have to determine whether I save the life of my brother...or the lives of the citizens. That decision falls on me.",
        "real_en": "...I'm a strategist. I have to decide whether to save my younger brother or the people of this city."
      },
      "review": {
