      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ええ、なんとしても\r\nこの防衛線を守りましょう。",
        "official_en": "I concur. We have to maintain the perimeter and push back the incoming monsters!",
        "real_en": "Yes. Whatever happens, we have to hold this defensive line."
      },
