      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "さぁ、忙しくなるな。\r\nレインたちの分も戦わねば。",
        "official_en": "Now, we should pace ourselves. We have to make up for the absence of Rain and the others, after all.",
        "real_en": "Looks like we'll be busy. We'll have to fight for Rain and the others, too."
      },
