      "text": {
        "jp": "それはわかるけど、心配じゃないのか？\r\nエルは弟だろ。",
        "official_en": "I know, but aren’t you worried? El’s your brother.",
        "real_en": "I understand, but aren't you worried? El's your younger brother."
